  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 10,000 gp (lesser), 20,000 gp (normal), 40,000 gp (greater)<br>\n<strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.; <strong>Feat Cost</strong> 2 sp</p>\n<p>You can alter a spell with a range of touch, close, or medium to increase its range to a higher range category, using the following order: touch, close, medium, and long. Unlike most metamagic effects, you may activate this metamagic multiple times for the same casting to increase its range. A reaching metamagic apparatus has 5 charges per day instead of the usual 3.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Reach Spell; <strong>Cost</strong> 5,000 gp (lesser), 10,000 gp (normal), 20,000 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Selected profile: lesser tier; held slender rod. Use as part of casting a qualifying sphere effect while holding this apparatus in at least one hand. The effect must be caster level seven or lower. Spend one of 5 daily uses; only one metamagic apparatus may apply per casting. Its feat’s extra spell-point and casting-time costs are waived, but normal effect and other-metamagic costs still apply.</p><p>Each activation advances one category along touch, close, medium and long. This apparatus has five daily uses and can be activated repeatedly for the same casting, with one use per range step. Only one apparatus still applies to that casting.</p><p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic\">Shared metamagic apparatus rules</a>. Feat Cost applies to taking the feat, not using the physical apparatus.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
